  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Narglatch</defName>
    <label>narglatch</label>
    <description>The Narglatch was a stealthy apex predator which could be found in diverse environments, such as the swamps of Naboo or the frozen tundras of Orto Plutonia. The narglatch male had additional fleshy spikes, while females were smoother and slightly smaller. They both had non-retractable claws and a fan-like tail that acted as a rudder during high-speed chases and turns. The narglatch also had densely padded feet that made for silent footfalls.</description>
